cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use anatta, please cite it."
type: software
title: "anatta: an open harness for the AI Conditioning Protocol"
abstract: >-
  An open harness for testing whether selflessness in AI must be reached
  rather than installed. It extracts self-interested drives ("ego") as
  directions in activation space, loosens them by activation surgery or by
  koan environments in which every egoic strategy defeats itself, and scores
  the result with a benchmark that separates release from sedation and from
  cosplay, without self-report.
authors:
